  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Climate Change Programme - Pacific Climate Mobility Partnerships (PCCMHS Phase 3)</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">A third phase of work to support Pacific priority action to address the impacts of climate change on people movement. The activity will deliver tailored support to nine target countries (Tonga, PNG, Fiji, Solomon Islands, Tuvalu, Vanuatu, Niue, Palau, Marshall Islands) as well as regional action to support country capability, evidence and information, and peer to peer exchange.</narrative>
  </description>
